WEBVTT

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:19.000
I activate Meklord Emperor Skiel's effect!

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.750
Once per turn, Meklord Emperor Skiel 
absorbs a Synchro Monster on your field!

00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:33.460
Ancient Fairy Dragon...

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:36.980
Stop it!  Release Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:47.210
Now there's nothing you can do!

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:51.180
Meklord Emperor Skiel attacks Luca directly!

00:00:56.830 --> 00:00:59.770
Luciano?  Who's that?

00:00:59.770 --> 00:01:06.100
Who?  The transfer student 
from Duel Academy East School!

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:08.830
Duel Academy East School?

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:11.600
What are you talking about?

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:13.050
See you.

00:01:16.530 --> 00:01:18.500
What's going on?

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:23.410
We're facing powerful enemies.

00:01:25.530 --> 00:01:29.640
I have to perfect it soon 
in order to fight them.

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:33.750
The Synchro Summon beyond Synchro...

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:37.100
Accel Synchro!

00:01:54.940 --> 00:02:00.080
Every time you're hurt, you can become kinder

00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:05.610
Stand up and you'll understand strength

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:10.090
Don't look back and keep going

00:02:10.320 --> 00:02:15.920
Both the past and the future 
are connected to the present

00:02:16.090 --> 00:02:20.900
There's no need to fear

00:02:21.130 --> 00:02:28.570
I'll keep telling you that you're not alone

00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:34.580
The passionate emotions in your heart

00:02:35.310 --> 00:02:40.350
Streak to the infinite future

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:45.750
Dreams surpass their limits

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:53.860
And will lead you to a bright place

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:26.430
To the Unseen World

00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:53.610
What's up, Jack?

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:56.900
I don't recall owning that table and chair.

00:03:57.610 --> 00:03:59.890
I made it using spare parts.

00:03:59.890 --> 00:04:02.560
You look like a rich socialite.

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:06.320
I see!  You've decided to save money!

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:08.020
Exactly.

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:10.210
That's a good attitude.

00:04:10.210 --> 00:04:14.060
You won't waste money anymore 
at the café across the street.

00:04:17.470 --> 00:04:19.940
Jack!

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:22.170
Where's Yusei?

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:25.130
He's probably out testing the new engine.

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:26.230
Probably?

00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:29.130
By the time I woke up, he was already gone.

00:04:29.650 --> 00:04:32.910
Yusei pulled another all-nighter.

00:04:34.150 --> 00:04:38.100
He's having trouble improving the engine.

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:41.000
Maybe he's feeling the pressure.

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:42.590
Maybe.

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:49.030
But if we don't have a new engine, 
it'll be hard to win the WRGP.

00:04:49.670 --> 00:04:56.210
It's a shame that when it comes 
to power, we're not very helpful.

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:58.680
Too bad, but it's true.

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:08.850
Can't you even make a chair?

00:05:08.850 --> 00:05:11.060
You can't talk to me like that.

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:18.200
When Yusei isn't around, 
we can't do anything.

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:21.410
I don't want to admit it, but you're right.

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:29.440
Do you think we truly understand Yusei?

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:31.170
What do you mean?

00:05:31.690 --> 00:05:36.550
We combined our powers to save this city.

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:43.730
We tore down the border between Neo Domino City 
and Satellite and built the Neo Daedalus Bridge.

00:05:45.260 --> 00:05:52.000
Why?  Didn't Crimson Dragon choose 
me because I'm going to become a god?

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.330
You're wrong!  It chose our bond!

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:57.940
With our bond, we will overcome destiny!

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:02.230
Yusei!

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:06.180
My turn!

00:06:08.230 --> 00:06:15.190
When Stardust Dragon is on my field, I can 
Special Summon Stardust Xiaolong from my graveyard!

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:21.120
Then I summon Majestic Dragon!

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:26.090
That card is...

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:33.080
Level 1 Majestic Dragon tunes Level 8 
Stardust Dragon and Level 1 Stardust Xiaolong!

00:06:37.060 --> 00:06:41.210
The shining stars come together 
to illuminate a new miracle!

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:43.210
Become the path that lights the way!

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:45.540
Synchro Summon!

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:48.650
Bring the light, Majestic Star Dragon!

00:06:52.360 --> 00:06:55.140
Our bond now comes together!

00:06:55.830 --> 00:07:00.080
Majestic Star Dragon 
gains 2400 attack points!

00:07:01.550 --> 00:07:06.310
Majestic Star Dragon attacks 
Earthbound Immortal Wiraqocha Rasca!

00:07:06.310 --> 00:07:08.710
Shooting Blaster Sonic!

00:07:18.070 --> 00:07:25.390
But during the battle against the Dark 
Signers, I heard his heart scream.

00:07:25.390 --> 00:07:30.100
If my father didn't do research, the 
accident 17 years ago wouldn't have happened.

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:33.850
That accident took the lives 
of Jack and Crow's parents.

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:37.130
It messed up everyone's lives!

00:07:37.800 --> 00:07:43.800
If it never happened, they would have 
caring parents and lived peaceful lives!

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:48.620
But they still regard me as their friend!

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:51.700
They smile at me without saying a word!

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:54.250
What am I supposed to do?

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:56.960
How am I supposed to atone for them?

00:07:57.760 --> 00:07:59.070
Yusei...

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:00.730
Answer me!

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:02.390
Answer me, Rutger!

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:06.230
That's the darkness in your heart.

00:08:06.430 --> 00:08:08.950
I'll give you an answer, Yusei!

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:15.140
Crow...

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:20.310
Yusei, I didn't know you were 
burdened with those feelings.

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:21.790
I'm sorry.

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:26.480
I'm your friend.  I should've noticed.

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:27.690
Crow...

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:34.370
But Yusei, I never thought for a second 
that you or your father ruined my life!

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:38.190
So you don't need to feel responsible!

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:45.170
If I believed in destiny, it 
would only be about meeting you!

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:49.410
Only about meeting you and Jack, 
two irreplaceable friends!

00:08:49.410 --> 00:08:52.480
Yusei, win for us!

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:54.480
Crow...

00:08:58.920 --> 00:09:02.170
That's the darkness in Yusei's heart.

00:09:02.170 --> 00:09:03.370
Yeah.

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:09.880
He could never tell us that he was 
carrying a huge burden inside his heart.

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:15.370
I don't want Yusei to feel like that again.

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:21.280
But Yusei will never succumb to that.

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:23.980
That's true.

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:28.700
He's the only person who changed my life.

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:31.380
He's my only rival!

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:35.090
"Only?"  What about me?

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:37.590
You're an entertaining teammate.

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:43.810
Where are you going?

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:47.530
I feel like riding with Yusei.

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:52.470
Wait up!

00:09:52.470 --> 00:09:54.510
I'm coming too!

00:10:00.350 --> 00:10:01.380
It's no good.

00:10:01.380 --> 00:10:03.850
At this speed, I can't beat him.

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:10.850
You fell for it.

00:10:11.430 --> 00:10:17.920
When an effect destroys Wise Core, all 
monsters on my field are destroyed.

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:22.640
Then from my deck or my hand, I can 
Special Summon Meklord Emperor Wisel...

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:24.150
Wisel Top...

00:10:24.150 --> 00:10:25.770
Wisel Attack...

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:27.840
Wisel Guard...

00:10:27.840 --> 00:10:30.170
...and Wisel Carrier!

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:34.140
You summoned five monsters at once?

00:10:34.140 --> 00:10:36.400
It's too early to be surprised.

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:39.870
I activate Meklord Emperor Wisel's effect!

00:11:03.610 --> 00:11:07.710
Meklord Emperor Wisel's effect activates!

00:11:12.460 --> 00:11:14.250
Stardust Dragon?

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:20.460
Once a turn, Wisel can absorb a 
Synchro Monster on your field!

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:21.190
What?

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:30.820
No way!  Stardust Dragon...

00:11:30.820 --> 00:11:32.040
...was captured!

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:39.630
Wisel gains attack points equal to the 
attack points of the Synchro Monster it equips.

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:42.750
Stardust Dragon has 2500 attack points.

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:47.890
Therefore, Wisel gains 2500 attack points!

00:11:48.150 --> 00:11:51.160
It absorbed Stardust's attack points!

00:11:51.160 --> 00:11:53.140
5000 attack points!

00:11:53.820 --> 00:11:55.960
Go, Meklord Emperor Wisel!

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:58.240
Attack Yusei Fudo directly!

00:11:59.260 --> 00:12:04.100
Yusei Fudo, your own monster's 
power will defeat you!

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:08.910
What?

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:11.340
The mark of the Crimson Dragon?

00:12:13.200 --> 00:12:14.340
The mark...

00:12:14.340 --> 00:12:15.800
...is glowing!

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:19.120
Yusei is asking for our strength!

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:26.060
The mark of the Crimson Dragon.

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:29.660
I see!  You're lending me your strength!

00:12:29.910 --> 00:12:34.870
Ghost, no matter what you try, 
you can't stop our evolution!

00:12:34.870 --> 00:12:36.920
This is proof!

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:40.030
Draw!

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:42.770
Appear, Majestic Dragon!

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:50.130
I activate the trap Synchro Material!

00:12:50.130 --> 00:12:56.930
Synchro Material lets me use a monster 
on your field to Synchro Summon!

00:12:56.930 --> 00:12:57.720
What?

00:12:58.320 --> 00:13:01.210
Return, Stardust Dragon!

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:10.240
Stardust!

00:13:10.240 --> 00:13:11.840
You did it, Yusei!

00:13:12.940 --> 00:13:20.410
Level 1 Majestic Dragon tunes Level 8 
Stardust Dragon and Level 1 Unicycular!

00:13:20.410 --> 00:13:21.920
Synchro Summon!

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:24.980
Arrive, Majestic Star Dragon!

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:32.850
Meklord Emperor Wisel is a 
monster made of five cards.

00:13:32.850 --> 00:13:37.100
Now that your effect is negated, 
I can attack any of its parts!

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:38.950
You knew that?

00:13:38.950 --> 00:13:42.190
I'm attacking Meklord Emperor's head!

00:13:43.310 --> 00:13:45.810
Go, Majestic Star Dragon!

00:13:45.810 --> 00:13:49.560
Attack Wisel Top!  Shooting Blaster Sonic!

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:03.630
I won that time because of 
the Crimson Dragon's power.

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:07.660
But if the Crimson Dragon's 
power didn't activate...

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:12.350
I would've lost.

00:14:45.060 --> 00:14:46.960
I knew you'd be here.

00:14:47.550 --> 00:14:49.390
Jack...  Crow...

00:14:49.390 --> 00:14:52.570
This spot has an awesome view.

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:56.600
Neo Domino City has changed 
greatly in six months.

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:57.980
What's up?

00:14:58.310 --> 00:15:00.780
We came to see how you're doing.

00:15:02.510 --> 00:15:05.410
The engine isn't working well yet.

00:15:05.410 --> 00:15:09.220
There's still time.  Don't worry so much.

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:10.520
I know.

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:13.530
But at this rate, I can't beat him.

00:15:13.530 --> 00:15:15.100
You mean Ghost.

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:17.280
Yeah.  He's a powerful enemy.

00:15:17.280 --> 00:15:20.860
Who was he anyway?

00:15:22.010 --> 00:15:25.990
Even if he was a machine, someone 
had to be controlling him.

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:28.730
I have a guess.

00:15:28.730 --> 00:15:29.960
Who?

00:15:30.480 --> 00:15:31.410
Iliaster.

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:36.540
Iliaster?  You think they sent Ghost?

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:44.160
During my battle with Rutger, he said that 
he met a man from Iliaster at the Nazca Lines.

00:15:46.310 --> 00:15:50.570
I've also heard that name 
from Godwin many times.

00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:53.130
They're a secret society 
that controls the world.

00:15:53.130 --> 00:15:56.500
They've been around since long ago.

00:15:56.950 --> 00:16:04.020
Iliaster used both Godwin and Rutger to 
cause Zero Reverse at Neo Domino City.

00:16:04.340 --> 00:16:08.640
And I've heard their name again recently.

00:16:08.640 --> 00:16:09.740
What?

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:15.450
I'm Sherry LeBlanc.

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:18.430
I was testing your abilities.

00:16:18.670 --> 00:16:22.770
Yusei, why do you duel?

00:16:22.770 --> 00:16:25.660
Why are you entering the WRGP?

00:16:26.030 --> 00:16:28.370
What are you trying to say?

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:30.710
I have a goal.

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:35.040
I have a huge goal called revenge.

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:36.740
Revenge...

00:16:45.450 --> 00:16:47.820
Papa!  Mama!

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:55.830
I fled around the world and learned that a 
certain organization was behind the company.

00:16:57.000 --> 00:16:59.700
It was Iliaster.

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:01.080
Iliaster!

00:17:01.260 --> 00:17:06.870
Iliaster is a legendary organization that 
surpasses the ideas of good and evil.

00:17:06.870 --> 00:17:10.740
They will do anything to eliminate 
anyone who gets in their way.

00:17:11.640 --> 00:17:13.730
Such as killing my family.

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:15.680
Horrible...

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:19.080
Yusei, help me.

00:17:19.080 --> 00:17:23.390
Iliaster is pulling the 
strings of the upcoming WRGP.

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:24.840
What?

00:17:24.840 --> 00:17:31.140
Iliaster is also involved in the 
deaths of D-Wheeler Sherry's parents?

00:17:31.340 --> 00:17:38.030
If Sherry's story is true, Iliaser is 
deeply involved in the upcoming WRGP.

00:17:38.290 --> 00:17:42.340
You predict that it won't 
be an ordinary tournament.

00:17:42.340 --> 00:17:43.250
Yeah.

00:17:43.550 --> 00:17:48.010
There's a huge conspiracy 
brewing behind the WRGP.

00:17:48.010 --> 00:17:50.200
That's how I feel.

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:52.100
What conspiracy?

00:17:52.100 --> 00:17:54.110
I don't know yet.

00:17:54.940 --> 00:17:57.350
And we're still participating?

00:17:57.350 --> 00:18:00.290
We're like moths to a flame.

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:02.290
Go ahead and ambush us!

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:03.800
I don't care if it's a trap!

00:18:03.800 --> 00:18:06.420
What's wrong, Jack?  Are you scared?

00:18:06.420 --> 00:18:08.620
You dare ask me that?

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:10.860
You've lost your edge, Crow.

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:17.590
If anyone steps in Jack Atlas's way, 
I'll destroy them with my power!

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:19.100
Right.

00:18:19.100 --> 00:18:22.750
No matter what happens, 
we'll protect this city.

00:18:22.750 --> 00:18:30.990
If Iliaster is controlling Ghost, then 
Ghost is an enemy that we must defeat!

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:34.330
There's only one way to do that!

00:18:34.540 --> 00:18:38.550
How dare you show up and act so superior!

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:39.930
What do you mean?

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:41.610
Come with me.

00:18:41.610 --> 00:18:44.690
Instead of telling you, it's 
quicker if you experience it.

00:18:44.690 --> 00:18:49.690
I'll teach you a new strategy 
that you know nothing about.

00:18:50.750 --> 00:18:52.430
A new strategy...

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:56.580
Watch, Yusei!

00:18:56.580 --> 00:18:59.950
This is the new battle 
technique to defeat Ghost!

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:01.530
Accel Synchro!

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:02.690
Accel Synchro?

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:14.180
If I remember correctly, we couldn't 
see what he did inside that light.

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:16.370
What happened?

00:19:16.780 --> 00:19:19.370
What he did was...

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:34.650
He vanished.

00:19:50.170 --> 00:19:52.000
What happened?

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:53.700
What's that monster?

00:19:54.010 --> 00:19:58.170
It's the Accel Synchro Monster 
Tech Genus Blade Blaster!

00:19:58.480 --> 00:20:00.580
Accel Synchro Monster?

00:20:00.580 --> 00:20:05.290
You Synchro Summoned a Synchro 
Monster during my turn?

00:20:05.290 --> 00:20:10.480
It's a Synchro Summon that uses a Synchro 
Tuner Monster and a Synchro Monster.

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:13.130
It's an Accel Synchro Summon!

00:20:14.180 --> 00:20:17.760
It's another Synchro Summon 
after a Synchro Summon.

00:20:17.760 --> 00:20:19.430
Accel Synchro!

00:20:23.470 --> 00:20:29.030
This is what he meant when he said 
that I had to overcome my limits.

00:20:29.730 --> 00:20:31.410
Accel Synchro?

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:35.190
Yes.  It's the ultimate Synchro Summon!

00:20:35.740 --> 00:20:37.380
I see.

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:42.240
That technique can counteract the 
mysterious robot's capture effect.

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:44.950
Overcome my limits?

00:20:44.950 --> 00:20:47.470
Is that really possible?

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:48.820
Definitely.

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:53.920
Beyond the limits of speed, there's 
a world that we haven't seen yet!

00:20:58.660 --> 00:21:01.290
This is getting interesting.

00:21:01.290 --> 00:21:03.040
Let's do it!

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:07.550
If I lose at speed, I'll lose my 
reputation as Crow the Bullet!

00:21:07.550 --> 00:21:10.100
Overcome my limits...

00:21:11.530 --> 00:21:14.760
I can't stay silent when I hear that!

00:21:15.400 --> 00:21:20.140
But in order to do that, 
we need a new engine.

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:24.460
Yusei, if you need anything, just ask!

00:21:24.460 --> 00:21:27.030
We'll do anything to help!

00:21:27.030 --> 00:21:32.370
Right!  Let's find the unseen 
world that's beyond our limits!

00:22:10.020 --> 00:22:14.700
The small cliff floats on the Milky Way

00:22:14.700 --> 00:22:19.710
The sights I see are different 
than what I imagined

00:22:19.990 --> 00:22:24.610
Were you able to move on from the past?

00:22:24.610 --> 00:22:29.620
The answer isn't no, but 
there's something missing

00:22:29.820 --> 00:22:34.490
The cruel god tests us

00:22:34.790 --> 00:22:41.430
Let's fill the emptiness 
and head to the next stage

00:22:41.430 --> 00:22:45.300
If you ask me "What's our relationship?"

00:22:45.300 --> 00:22:51.170
We're more than friends... 
but that's not quite right

00:22:51.340 --> 00:22:55.090
Bond is the proper word

00:22:55.090 --> 00:23:01.070
As we fight, we understand each other

00:23:01.070 --> 00:23:04.040
"Where are you right now?"  "On Earth"

00:23:04.040 --> 00:23:06.270
Because I'm not an astronaut

00:23:06.270 --> 00:23:10.950
I have no problems when 
I'm below the ozone layer

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:13.810
"I know, I'm coming right away."

00:23:13.810 --> 00:23:17.280
You want to party until the morning

00:23:17.280 --> 00:23:20.520
At our special place
